            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0833" n="705" xml:id="pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">717.2114/71: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Piles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-16T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 17 (<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">?</hi>)—10:20 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>94. Department’s 55, September 15, 1 p.m. Text of treaty has not yet been made
                    public but the President has publicly stated the general provisions of the
                    treaty in his recent annual message to Congress. To date there has been no press
                    comment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Piles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
